      {
        "npc": "Can I help you, [sir/madam]?"
      },
      {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "What is this place?",
            "steps": [
              {
                "player": "What is this place?"
              },
              {
                "npc": "This is the Emir's Arena. Fighters come from far and wide to arrange fights against their friends and rivals. They can fight in 1v1 Tournaments or Duels."
              },
              {
                "type": "message",
                "text": "The Arena is open only on PvP Arena worlds. Switch to one of those game worlds to play in the Arena.",
                "id": "DU_X3k"
              },
              {
                "npc": "Head over to the hospital north of the Arena, and speak to the Guides. They'll help you sign up to a fight. Now, can I help you with anything else?"
              },
              {
                "type": "jump",
                "reference": "other",
                "id": "uuPFzU"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "What do you do here?",
            "steps": [
              {
                "player": "What do you do here?"
              },
              {
                "npc": "The Emir of Al-Kharid has decreed that his Arena should be guarded, to stop ruffians like the Calamity Coven from returning. But is there something I can do for you?"
              },
              {
                "type": "choice",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "text": "Tell me about the Calamity Coven.",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "player": "Tell me about the Calamity Coven."
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "The Calamity Coven were three brigands, followers of an ancient and derelict religion. Through their foul arts, they turned this Arena into a hotbed of corruption."
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "Maoma was a captain of the Emir's guard, but she abused her authority to rig fights so that the Coven would get rich at the people's expense."
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "Saika was the brains behind their operation, forging the Arena's accounts so that the Coven could keep all the profits, starving the Emir's public works of all funding."
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "Koriff used her charms to act as a gracious hostess, whipping up the crowds' excitement so that they'd gamble more and more unwisely, enriching the Coven."
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "The Calamity Coven are long gone now; some of their old possessions are even being sold as rewards. Now, we are here to prevent a resurgence in such crime. But is there something I can do for you?"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "choice",
                        "options": [
                          {
                            "text": "What is this place?",
                            "steps": [
                              {
                                "type": "jump",
                                "reference": "above",
                                "id": "HobKFq"
                              }
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Tell me again about the Calamity Coven.",
                            "steps": [
                              {
                                "type": "jump",
                                "reference": "above",
                                "id": "4G4hDz"
                              }
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Could you come help me with something?",
                            "steps": [
                              {
                                "type": "jump",
                                "reference": "below",
                                "id": "preSNo"
                              }
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "I'm fine, thanks.",
                            "steps": [
